{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:AppendixStandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization","@type":"LeanModule","name":"AppendixStandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Endomorphism","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Hom.Defs"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization.of_injective_comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization.of_injective_comp","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/gauge-hecke-realization.lean#L68-L77","doc":"Monotonicity: a realization survives enlarging the target along\nany injective monoid homomorphism (e.g. `H_n(q) ↪ H_{n+1}(q)` under\na tower inclusion). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.not_gaugeHeckeRealization_of_subsingleton","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.not_gaugeHeckeRealization_of_subsingleton","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/gauge-hecke-realization.lean#L57-L66","doc":"The conjecture class has falsifiable content: it fails whenever\n`H` is too small. If any state carries two distinct gauge\nautomorphisms, no realization into a subsingleton monoid exists. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization.aut_embeds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization.aut_embeds","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/gauge-hecke-realization.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Every state's gauge automorphism monoid embeds in `H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization.mk","kind":"ctor","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/gauge-hecke-realization.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.StandardModel.GaugeHeckeRealization","kind":"class","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/gauge-hecke-realization.lean#L41-L55","doc":"**Conjecture (Hecke realization of gauge symmetry).** For the\ngroupoid `S` of topological states and a monoid `H` (intended: the\nmultiplicative monoid of the Hecke algebra `H_n(q)`), every state's\nautomorphism monoid embeds in `H` via a monoid homomorphism. The\ncontent field asserts the embedding for *every* state — faithfulness\nmeans no gauge transformation is collapsed in the Hecke image.\n\nIntended instantiation: `S` = knot-state groupoid of the QOU\nsubstrate, `H` = `H_n(q)` under multiplication. Open: no instance\nfor that instantiation is known; providing one requires exhibiting\nthe injective homs, which is precisely the open derivation. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:gauge-hecke-realization","label":"conj:gauge-hecke-realization","md":"quantum-observable-universe/appendix-standard-model/gauge-hecke-realization.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}